 "id": "670388527264338", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031323_670388530597671_5490469913338689382_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ANg-mOTdJs8Q7kNvwGcT0HA&_nc_oc=Adp4SHao89uai9Ytw9FtQSMQBAI1qfaqr4yvsnwKMR87VnxRbUbLlyEh6ARgwzDSaOI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL-xEvR94BjHGm-KgdzR-0B4OkKRv628t3rqJLFrkuTEg&oe=6AA9325F"}, {"file_name": "Tower Tag Screenshot 2.png", "id": "907975100116080", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003259_907975103449413_7656664959858111418_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WWd-gW9blcEQ7kNvwHDLai5&_nc_oc=AdpqSLNHpB9KdJ8ZJRrDN9VK_wMk1X9xKIkjv7ZsRNbeJvMuz5H28UnzxGvdcYSFwTY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJCB9VPqywzXtAWD4e_vBVlH8t05KHqI9o_C97WvkZgag&oe=6AA95FD5"}, {"file_name": "Tower Tag Screenshot 3.png", "id": "168422975392861", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001729_168422978726194_821451168504875527_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NZaBmSXDZUwQ7kNvwEqSUIM&_nc_oc=AdpfSZ2vevpNbmGMKSlqSj7fpa8Xbl4QyxcHUV8K8fHCFS4M3EJ1BgF44dyokDyhgkM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLKm1gH7Ii5mYphBvXJ-3FRUuF0c6fTOKqTxBHTjKoWHA&oe=6AA96520"}, {"file_name": "Tower Tag Screenshot 4.png", "id": "545737423294026", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974720_545737426627359_3418342792352847773_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SNjHBrtfZGkQ7kNvwH21qgJ&_nc_oc=AdqJYR5I7XZTR1pyVUIdnLoELBhuP2lG4QaIIucVRiSoHBlG9kzNvrTkw8gCCQsgqMo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLDS2NhIQIaAp11sRgWJX9lfKcILT93bL0khrXZqDiNgA&oe=6AA93A75"}, {"file_name": "Tower Tag Screenshot 5.png", "id": "520008265743970", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974538_520008269077303_7443019661941137749_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DbKc6fCawWYQ7kNvwFudCFF&_nc_oc=AdpgcAO91E35zHrW9M_qNbNsZGZPM8iri3fVh6EcyeqpgmapcuKh8MGflmr8IjnnnQY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIGriPwJeRReP_n9jeFVGkCbLpsz80G1IJuvvsFtnXgmQ&oe=6AA95399"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "capsule_main.png", "id": "1932295487232755", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031470_1932295490566088_8845111807748253844_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fKAu0xvLZJAQ7kNvwGE-udK&_nc_oc=AdoeN3K1BFsYiceQ0eDCmNCJn8eWhIwNQyIhhHXD9DOUlBKxxg7WsZvvaOt83v0qxOg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQInp9usFCrO9J9HBW1DhrMZ3kR8tFN25-Xr7bSTXEQMeA&oe=6AA942D6"}, "display_name": "Tower Tag", "keywords": ["lasertag", "laser", "esports", "sale", "quest"], "long_description": "**Dive into the World of TOWER TAG Where hyper-dynamic action meets thrilling PVP battles.** \n\n**No Motion Sickness Movement**\n\nSay goodbye to motion sickness. TOWER TAG's intuitive grappling hook makes rapid movement second nature.\n{449451971417020}\n\n**Strategic and Impactful**\n\nTeam up, capture towers, and conquer the battlefield with tactical precision. Speed is your ally, and the element of surprise your weapon.\n{4576815695876082}\n\n**Effortless Control**\n\nWe've kept the controls simple, letting you immerse yourself fully. In TOWER TAG, your body becomes the controller, and the game flows naturally.\n{375037532292289}\n\n**Content**\n- **Multiplayer:** Enjoy cross-platform multiplayer between different mobile VR platforms.\n- **Match Variety:** Engage in 1v1, 2v2, 3v3, and 4v4 matches.\n- **Diverse Maps:** Explore a variety of maps and environments.\n- **Motion Sickness-Free:** Experience smooth grappling hook movement and intuitive Paintball mechanics without.\n- **Safe Space:** Move freely even in small spaces.\n- **Game Modes:** Play three different team modes: Deathmatch, Elimination, and Goal Tower.\n- **Intelligent Bots:** Practice with smart AI opponents.\n- **Ranked Play:** Climb the rankings with leaderboards.\n- **Enhanced Experience:** Enjoy support for bHaptics vests and other immersive equipment.\n\nHop into our **official Tower Tag Discord** to connect with other players, join matches and share feedback.\n\ud83d\udc49 https://discord.gg/mptpJk2\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Tower Tag is a hyper-dynamic futuristic paintball like PVP shooter with a grappling hook locomotion method that becomes second nature instantly. Without any motion sickness!"}]}, "developer_name": "Steinfatt GmbH", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tower-tag-main.webflow.io/privacy-policy-tower-tag", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Steinfatt GmbH", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://tower-tag-main.webflow.io/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "SHOOTER", "ARCADE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "th", "zh_CN", "ko", "de", "es"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "10065533410172875"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974578_134569615231532_4812547263809071213_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0BpWXFwSmk0Q7kNvwG4fOx-&_nc_oc=AdpNDoNQnCq2iM4l2ZvHGnDI0cGCjsn4PeMTduJnAcSQYf1sxMYQ1SuGmmqStk0i2mQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLHQpAr_jRm0b1GUiKS56HFZ_H